      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    fund_value = 100_000_000\n    current_equity_allocation = 0.80\n    target_equity_allocation = 0.60\n    equity_beta = 1.20\n    futures_beta = 0.95\n    index_value = 1_200\n    contract_multiplier = 250\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    equity_exposure_to_adjust = (\n        fund_value\n        * (current_equity_allocation - target_equity_allocation)\n        * equity_beta\n    )\n    futures_contract_value = index_value * contract_multiplier\n    beta_adjusted_futures_value = futures_contract_value * futures_beta\n\n    number_of_contracts = equity_exposure_to_adjust / beta_adjusted_futures_value\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(number_of_contracts, 3)\n```",
